      "song_duration_ms": 10422
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p04",
      "text": "Wind blows snow up in low, narrow drifts. Snow blown off a roof shows up as smoke.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_074/pages/p04.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_074/audio/pages/p04.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7993,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_074/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8463
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "Dig deep in the snow and it glows blue. A snow shadow is blue, not grey.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_074/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_074/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7941,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_074/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7862
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "Frost on a window is not snow. It grows flat on the glass in fern shapes.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_074/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_074/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6817,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_074/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8515
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "Yellow snow is a dog's mark \u2014 do not eat it. Pink snow is alive: tiny plants grow in it!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_074/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_074/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8724,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_074/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9639
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "Push a snowball and it grows. Wet snow holds. Dry snow will not, so no snowman.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_074/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_074/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8306,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
